  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The root mean square speed of smoke particles of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> in their Brownian motion in air at NTP is approximately.</p><p>[Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>]</p>"
